 card titan's body is destroyed  but the general is still inside the  cannon and manages to fire again  moving on there were several moments  featuring the beast titan in this  trailer and if you arrange the clips  into the correct order you realize  there's a lot of spoilers here for  example we see him show up as he throws  a bunch of rocks to destroy the malian  airships which leads to all these  burning ships crashing into the  buildings below as i just mentioned we  then get this scene of commander mcgath  firing the anti-titan cannon which then  hits zeke and causes him to fall to the  ground once on the ground the trailer  then shows us one of the beast titan's  greatest ever moments in the entire  series in my opinion and of course i'm  talking about him activating his scream  and turning every person in shiganchina  who drank the wine into a titan  unfortunately for falco he's one of the  unlucky people who did have the wine  even though it was literally just one  drop hence why there's these brief  horrifying shots of him and gabby  reacting to the scream  after this one of my favorite parts of  the trailer was aaron in his human form  running towards zeke because in the  background there's just the absolute  chaos of the scouts fighting against the  armored titan  during this scene the jaeger brothers  are desperately trying to make contact  so they can activate the power of the  founding titan while the malia military  are doing everything they can to prevent  this from happening  up until now they've tried to stop the  jaegers in various ways including rhino  fighting aaron and obviously them  shooting zeke but in this moment right  here the only thing standing in their  way is gabby's anti-titan rifle  now switching over to the past dimension  we got what is probably the clearest  look at yamir fritz in anime so far and  for those who might not know yamiya  fritz was the original founding titan  in this scene she emerges from the  coordinate and begins walking in erin's  direction as he himself is standing  directly in front of it the pars  dimension is a place that exists outside  of the normal world and in special  circumstances aldians are able to go  there which is why both jaeger brothers  are seen there together  spoiler warning ahead but the reason  they touch in this scene in the past  dimension is because zeke wants to use  the founding titan to take aaron into  their father's memories and by doing so  he's trying to prove that grisha had  brainwashed aaron in the same way he  tried to bring more zeke when he was a  child  the reason i mentioned this spoiler is  because at the beginning of the trailer  we saw a weird image of their father  almost like he'd been frozen in time and  i think these two moments are directly  related  we know from the manga that after the  jager brothers go into grisha's memories  they start observing important points  from his life and one of those important  points is when he went to confront the  royal family this scene of grisha on his  knees is almost certainly from that same  moment and i have a pretty good theory  as to why he looks like he's frozen in  time  the reason grisha is frozen is because  it's an artistic choice and it's the  anime's way of showing us how the power  of the attack titan really works  the manga showed us that aaron's attack  titan effectively gives him the power to  send memories into the past therefore  based on what we see in this trailer the  sequence could then pan out to show us  all the memories that eren has sent his  father because if you don't have that  then it will be really confusing so yeah  i feel like the anime is doing this so  that people will more easily understand  what the attack titan is capable of my  guess is there's just a visual  representation of how the attack titan  works but if you have a theory let me  know  regardless of that the final thing i  wanted to mention about this trailer is  that there were several extended shots  of aaron charging towards reiner and  these two just beating each other up and  i gotta say the cgi titans look so good  for the second half of the season like  at some point it generally becomes hard  to tell the difference between this and  the 2d animation  i should probably mention as well that  there was this brief shot of when yank  upon opening the jail cell and then  following this we see all the scouts  coming outside and the reason he did  this is because essentially number one  he's a good guy and number two they  needed to let the scouts out so that  they could help save aaron from mali  because if aaron was to be killed then  they would lose the power of the  founding titan and without that power  pretty much the entire island is going  to get wiped out the founding titan and  its power to activate the rumbling is  the only thing that can save the island  from being destroyed by the outside  world and you know regardless of whether  you're a volunteer or whether you're a  scout aaron needs to be alive like  there's just no way around it you need  to save aaron if you want to live  anyway people thank you for watching  this trailer breakdown and be sure to  sub to the channel as i'm currently  working on a new video that will explain  the complete first half of the season in  about 20 minutes or less  it will likely be out sometime this week  or the latest next week so turn on  notifications if you want to see that  until the next one peace out

